### POST /api/runs - 创建跑步
# @name createRun
POST http://localhost:3000/api/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "test-user-1"
}

###

### POST /api/runs/{id}/points - 推 GPS 点
POST http://localhost:3000/api/runs/{{createRun.response.body.runId}}/points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": [
    { "lat": 32.041, "lng": 118.784, "timestamp": 1700000000000 },
    { "lat": 32.042, "lng": 118.785, "timestamp": 1700000005000 },
    { "lat": 32.043, "lng": 118.786, "timestamp": 1700000010000 }
  ]
}

###

### PATCH /api/runs/{id} - 结束跑步
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/runs/{{createRun.response.body.runId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "test-user-1",
  "endTime": "2024-01-01T08:30:00.000Z",
  "duration": 1861,
  "distance": 5.23,
  "avgPace": "5'43\""
}

###
